{"4557330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Board Of The Future", "steam_appid": 4557330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play however you want</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise leisurely over rolling hills and do some cool tricks. Or upgrade your board into an extremely fast beast and pull off the sickest moves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive motion controls—like snowboarding with your hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player and online <strong>multiplayer coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable boards with different characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your board: Collect various items to boost acceleration, speed, hoverforce, boost, and more. Enhance your board’s <strong>physics-based</strong> properties. But keep an eye on your energy consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sick Moves</strong>: Don't perform tricks by pressing buttons—do it by moving your hands. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>momentum-based hill-jumping and landing</strong> mechanic you´ve loved in other games: Your board is a hoverboard. But you can also reverse that momentum, accelerate downward, and thus make your landing smoother. It looks cool. It feels great.  And, of course, it gives you a boost.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play however you want</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise leisurely over rolling hills and do some cool tricks. Or upgrade your board into an extremely fast beast and pull off the sickest moves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive motion controls—like snowboarding with your hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player and online <strong>multiplayer coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable boards with different characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your board: Collect various items to boost acceleration, speed, hoverforce, boost, and more. Enhance your board’s <strong>physics-based</strong> properties. But keep an eye on your energy consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sick Moves</strong>: Don't perform tricks by pressing buttons—do it by moving your hands. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>momentum-based hill-jumping and landing</strong> mechanic you´ve loved in other games: Your board is a hoverboard. But you can also reverse that momentum, accelerate downward, and thus make your landing smoother. It looks cool. It feels great.  And, of course, it gives you a boost.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Is it a board? Is it a plane? Is it the coolest, fastest piece of alien technology from the future that you and your friends have ever been riding?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557330/b9754b44ab1803bd49422070019ca24a67019344/header.jpg?t=1787861346", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557330/7dba976b8e27d58c95bdb0e479ceb46fbe24f149/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787861346", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4557330/7dba976b8e27d58c95bdb0e479ceb46fbe24f149/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787861346", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, requires motion controllers</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  intel i7-6700 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 or AMD-RX-Vega-56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, requires motion controllers</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["TomyHorst"], "publishers": ["TomyHorst"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 27, "description": "Cross-Platform Multiplayer"}, {"id": 54, "description": "VR Only"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "9", "description": "Racing"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "18", "description": "Sports"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0